<title>CANADA: Intl Precious can't explain stock activity.</title>
<headline>Intl Precious can't explain stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Precious Metals Corp said on Monday it knows of no material developments to account for the recent activity in the trading of its shares.</p>
<p>IPM stock was halted on Nasdaq at at 8-1/4, up 1-1/4 from the open.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
